# MEHFIL AI — environment configuration
# Copy to .env.local for local development. Every value optional: the app runs
# fully in demo mode without any of these.

## — AI provider (server-side only; never exposed to the client) —
## With no key, the deterministic local core engine composes poetry and every
## result is labeled DEMO. With a key, the Anthropic Claude provider generates.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022

## — Admin research dashboard (server-side gate) —
## With no value, admin research endpoints answer 501 and stay read-only.
# MEHFIL_ADMIN_KEY=choose-a-long-random-string

## — Research ingestion (optional local write-through) —
## When "1", admin submissions are written to research/research-queue.json next to
## the app (dev/standalone only; serverless hosts are read-only for this file).
# MEHFIL_LOCAL_RESEARCH_WRITE=1

## — URL for self-reference (set on hosted deployments) —
# MEHFIL_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
